        "original_id": "4a26685b-e827-5b95-8c71-9679de367d77",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom, Amber, Sally, Steve, Katherine Parkinson, Justin Edwards, Simon Blackwell, Jesse Armstrong, Sam Bain\n- Works: The Old Guys, The IT Crowd, The Thick of It, In The Loop, Veep, Peep Show, Four Lions\n- Awards: British Comedy Best TV Actress Award, BAFTA TV Award\n\nFacts:\n- In The Old Guys, baby boomer Tom has little in life except his daughter Amber.\n- In The Old Guys, Amber is played by Katherine Parkinson.\n- In The Old Guys, Amber is dating Sally's son Steve.\n- In The Old Guys, Steve is played by Justin Edwards.\n- Katherine Parkinson appeared in several comedy series, including playing Jen Barber in Channel 4's The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson received the British Comedy Best TV Actress Award in 2009 for The IT Crowd.\n- Katherine Parkinson received a BAFTA TV Award in 2014 for The IT Crowd after being nominated in 2011.\n- Simon Blackwell is best known for his work on The Thick of It, In The Loop, and Veep.\n- Simon Blackwell collaborated with Jesse Armstrong and Sam Bain on Peep Show, Four Lions, and The Old Guys.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
